+/*
+* Patched to comment out '*.css' declaration for monorepo CSS Modules support.
+* The broad '*.css' pattern conflicts with Vite's CSS Module typing (*.module.css).
+* This is necessary because:
+* - @siemens/ix is built with Stencil and exports these types
+* - TypeScript's wildcard matching means '*.css' matches '*.module.css'
+* - This prevents proper CSS Module support in consuming packages
+* See: https://github.com/ionic-team/stencil/issues/3315
+*/
